  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core support IDOM</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">K&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d till IDOM</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sverige kommer att ge k&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d till IDOM, en civilsamh&#xe4;llsorganisation baserad i Moldavien, under perioden juni 2016 - juni 2019. K&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d ges f&#xf6;r att st&#xe4;rka IDOM&#xb4;s organisatoriska kapacitet och f&#xf6;r att bidra till implementeringen av deras strategiska plan 2016-2018 f&#xf6;r att fr&#xe4;mja m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter i Moldavien.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sweden will support IDOM, a civil society organisation from Moldova, to implement core support activities provided by IDOM&#x2019;s Strategic Plan and RAF during June 2016 - June 2018. Core support is granted to strengthen institutional capacities and to assist the implementation of IDOM&#x2019;s medium term Strategic Plan 2016-2019 in promoting human rights in Moldova.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sweden will support IDOM, a civil society organisation from Moldova, to implement core support activities provided by IDOM&#x2019;s Strategic Plan and RAF during June 2016 - June 2019. Core support is granted to strengthen institutional capacities and to assist the implementation of IDOM&#x2019;s medium term Strategic Plan 2016-2019 in promoting human rights in Moldova.</narrative>
  </description>
